	TAD I	(PEXUNIT)		/ADD ON UNIT BITS
	DCA	PEXCFUN			/STORE IN-LINE
	JMS I	PSYSIO/[SYSIO]		/CALL I/O ROUTINES
PEXCBUF,FILBUFFER			/BUFFER ADDRESS
